1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:07,500
A test cell with no opinion about the design.

2
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:17,500
Metadata locates equipment. Geometry carries the load.

3
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:24,500
STEP → exact solids → separate tet bodies → insert → settle → actuate/load → evidence.

4
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:30,500
Effective isotropic printed-PLA model. Recoverable elasticity—not a fracture model.

5
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:46,500
Every substantive candidate is preserved. Initial overlap is a failure. Numerical failure is inconclusive.

6
00:00:47,000 --> 00:01:02,500
The agent revises only from measured geometry, contact, motion, and solver evidence.

7
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:15,500
No candidate joints. No prescribed candidate motion. No direct force on a candidate body.

8
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:30,500
Physical insertion. Contact-only transmission. Evaluator-owned brake load.

9
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:38,500
The evidence panel reports the actual classification and immutable hashes.

10
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:44,000
The evaluator never trusted the design. It tested the geometry.

11
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:45,000
Simulation engineering evaluation under the shown model/settings; not real-world safety certification.
